# Backend

- Put a feature under `backend/src/features/<name>/` (routes, controllers, services, repositories).
- Request and response shapes are Zod schemas from `@pairkit/core/api`. Do not duplicate them here.
- Import `@pairkit/core` only as `@pairkit/core`, `@pairkit/core/api`, or `@pairkit/core/client`.
- Return `{ success, message, data }` via `uni-response` (`unifiedResponse`).
- Add env vars to `src/config/env-schema.ts` and `backend/.env.example` together. Other modules import `env` from `src/config/env-config.ts`.
- Do not import `web/` or `mobile/`.
